{"pageid":2750,"title":"Alan's Auto","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Alan&#039;s Auto</span>","revid":18970,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>(Old Alan's Auto</b> is the closed part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> shop located in Finlay owned by <a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Burk\" title=\"Alan Burk\">Alan Burk</a>. Alan's Auto only has one item for sale, that being the <a href=\"/wiki/Fever_Vinyl\" title=\"Fever Vinyl\">Fever Vinyl</a> for $600. It's unknown if this part of the shop is going to get used for something else in future updates. The interior of the closed shop has the same layout as the opened part of Alan's AutoLogistics exept for the walls having streets on the wall as some sort of decoration. At the back of the shop there's a broken window where you can enter the shop to access it.)\n</p><p><b>Alan's Auto</b> was changed in the <b>Shift in Terrain update</b>. in the new update you can now buy <b>Traffic Cones</b> and the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter\" title=\"Freyliner Transporter\">Freyliner Transporter</a></b>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Fever_Vinyl\" title=\"Fever Vinyl\"><b>Fever Vinyl</b></a> is now located in the roof supports inside of the building.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items\">Items</span></h3>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fever_Vinyl\" title=\"Fever Vinyl\">Fever Vinyl</a></td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/eb/Fever_Vinyl.webp/revision/latest?cb=20240805210851\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Fever Vinyl\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/eb/Fever_Vinyl